        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(x)=2x^3+5\\ln|3x+2|-2$; $f(2)=14+5\\ln 8$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=2x^3+5\\ln|3x+2|+C\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $f(1)=5\\ln 5$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2+5\\ln 5+C&=5\\ln 5\\\\C&=-2\\\\f(x)&=2x^3+5\\ln|3x+2|-2\\\\f(2)&=16+5\\ln 8-2\\\\f(2)&=14+5\\ln 8\\end{align*}$$",
